{{!-- EMAIL - WORKR 04 - Subhadip story (Day 7). Params: firstName, readinessLink. Subject is set by the sender, not here. --}}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Consider a different case</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f7fb; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#111827;">
  <table
    role="presentation"
    cellpadding="0"
    cellspacing="0"
    border="0"
    width="100%"
    style="width:100%; margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f7fb;"
  >
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px;">

        <table
          role="presentation"
          cellpadding="0"
          cellspacing="0"
          border="0"
          width="100%"
          style="width:100%; max-width:620px; background-color:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px;"
        >
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:30px 30px 26px 30px;">

              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                Hi {{firstName}},
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                Consider a different case.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                Subhadip De was already an experienced engineer working at AiDASH. So this wasn't a case of someone simply trying to get their first job. He wanted to move significantly higher.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                We worked with him on areas including DSA and System Design, helped get his interview process moving with Visa, and supported him with highly targeted preparation for the rounds he was facing.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                He eventually joined Visa as Software Engineer 2. His current LinkedIn publicly reflects his Visa SDE-2 role and his previous AiDASH experience.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                The important point is this: at higher levels, "learn DSA and apply" is not a complete career strategy. Your preparation, positioning, target companies, interview opportunities and company-specific execution have to work together.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 24px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                That's exactly what the readiness diagnostic is designed to uncover:
                <a
                  href="{{readinessLink}}"
                  target="_blank"
                  style="color:#2563eb; font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline;"
                >Check your readiness &rarr;</a>
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                &mdash; Sunyul<br />
                InterviewCall
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <table
          role="presentation"
          cellpadding="0"
          cellspacing="0"
          border="0"
          width="100%"
          style="width:100%; max-width:620px;"
        >
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:16px 8px 0 8px;">
              <p style="margin:0; font-size:12px; line-height:18px; color:#64748b;">
                You are receiving this because you signed up on WorkR. If you would rather not hear from us, just reply to this email and let us know.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
